{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064329/block/singleImage/3270332/df/01M7NFVTBCA9XHWF1GCHK850VR.png?updatedAt=1794944109\"/><figcaption>韓劇男神邊佑錫相隔半年再訪香港。</figcaption></figure><p>韓劇男神邊佑錫每次襲港均吸引大批粉絲支持，今年5月底他獲邀出席香港首屆《Hong Kong Comic Con》，跟丹麥巨星麥斯米基辛（Mads Mikkelsen）、《絕命毒師》（Breaking Bad）演員「炸雞叔」Giancarlo Esposito、《回到未來》（Back to the Future）飾演博士的基斯杜化萊（Christopher Lloyd）及古天樂等前輩級紅星同台亦未被比下去，成為盛會上的風頭躉。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064329/block/singleImage/3270334/df/01M7NFZ6CCCKTGZJ96EE3BVY91.jpeg?updatedAt=1794944109\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫今年5月底來港出席首屆《Hong Kong Comic Con》。</figcaption></figure><p>時隔半年，邊佑錫下周將再訪香港，今次他是應PRADA安排出席K11 MUSEA全新專門店的開幕活動。品牌專門店樓高兩層，佔地逾580平方米，完整呈現男女裝系列，透過精緻優雅的空間設計，展現品牌獨有的美學理念。為慶祝全新專門店隆重開幕，品牌將於下星期一（23日）下午舉行開幕活動，屆時品牌大使邊佑錫會親臨專門店，聯同容祖兒、王丹妮、何超蓮、Lynus胡智同及一眾時尚名人共同慶祝新店開幕。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064329/block/singleImage/3270336/df/01M7NG16MHPYWZVJ4PJGEREVJN.jpg?updatedAt=1794944109\"/><figcaption>PRADA將於下星期一舉行活動，屆時品牌大使邊佑錫會親臨專門店。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.208867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T15:37:25.070578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:36:53.871245+00:00","content_hash":"2a8f0e260f0d3a60e13c9cdb3a0eaed97a86b01aa77a48fc2334c7d188dd0022","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.208867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}